																								<script type="text/javascript">
							var StoreDefaults = {"PartnerEventStore":[{"gid":"489361401348883261","clan_steamid":"103582791475790724","event_name":"Demo 1.7: The Homeowners Have Arrived!","event_type":13,"appid":4776500,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1792361880,"rtime32_end_time":1792366201,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"A big Next Fest update: homeowners, a training area, new equipment and smoother multiplayer.\",\"Gro\u00dfes Next-Fest-Update: Hausbesitzer, Trainingsbereich, neue Ausr\u00fcstung und fl\u00fcssigerer Multiplayer.\",\"Grosse mise \u00e0 jour pour le Next Fest : propri\u00e9taires, zone d'entra\u00eenement, nouvel \u00e9quipement et multijoueur plus fluide.\",\"Grande aggiornamento per il Next Fest: padroni di casa, area di allenamento, nuova attrezzatura e online pi\u00f9 fluido.\",\"Next Fest \ub300\uaddc\ubaa8 \uc5c5\ub370\uc774\ud2b8: \uc9d1\uc8fc\uc778, \ud6c8\ub828\uc7a5, \uc0c8\ub85c\uc6b4 \uc7a5\ube44, \ub354 \ubd80\ub4dc\ub7ec\uc6b4 \uba40\ud2f0\ud50c\ub808\uc774.\",\"Gran actualizaci\u00f3n para el Next Fest: propietarios, zona de entrenamiento, nuevo equipo y multijugador m\u00e1s fluido.\",\"Steam \u65b0\u54c1\u8282\u5927\u578b\u66f4\u65b0\uff1a\u5c4b\u4e3b\u767b\u573a\u3001\u8bad\u7ec3\u533a\u3001\u65b0\u88c5\u5907\uff0c\u591a\u4eba\u8054\u673a\u66f4\u6d41\u7545\u3002\",\"Steam \u65b0\u54c1\u7bc0\u5927\u578b\u66f4\u65b0\uff1a\u5c4b\u4e3b\u767b\u5834\u3001\u8a13\u7df4\u5340\u3001\u65b0\u88dd\u5099\uff0c\u591a\u4eba\u9023\u7dda\u66f4\u6d41\u66a2\u3002\",\"\u041a\u0440\u0443\u043f\u043d\u043e\u0435 \u043e\u0431\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u043a Next Fest: \u0445\u043e\u0437\u044f\u0435\u0432\u0430 \u0434\u043e\u043c\u043e\u0432, \u0442\u0440\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0440\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0447\u043d\u0430\u044f \u0437\u043e\u043d\u0430, \u043d\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0435 \u0441\u043d\u0430\u0440\u044f\u0436\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0438 \u0431\u043e\u043b\u0435\u0435 \u043f\u043b\u0430\u0432\u043d\u044b\u0439 \u043c\u0443\u043b\u044c\u0442\u0438\u043f\u043b\u0435\u0435\u0440.\",null,\"Next Fest\u5411\u3051\u306e\u5927\u578b\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u30c7\u30fc\u30c8\uff1a\u5bb6\u4e3b\u3055\u3093\u3001\u30c8\u30ec\u30fc\u30cb\u30f3\u30b0\u30a8\u30ea\u30a2\u3001\u65b0\u88c5\u5099\u3001\u3088\u308a\u5feb\u9069\u306a\u30de\u30eb\u30c1\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u3002\",null,\"Du\u017ca aktualizacja na Next Fest: w\u0142a\u015bciciele dom\u00f3w, strefa treningowa, nowy sprz\u0119t i p\u0142ynniejsza gra wieloosobowa.\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"Next Fest i\u00e7in b\u00fcy\u00fck g\u00fcncelleme: ev sahipleri, antrenman alan\u0131, yeni ekipmanlar ve daha ak\u0131c\u0131 \u00e7ok oyunculu.\",\"Grande atualiza\u00e7\u00e3o para o Next Fest: donos da casa, \u00e1rea de treino, novos equipamentos e multijogador mais fluido.\",null,null,null,null,\"Gran actualizaci\u00f3n para el Next Fest: due\u00f1os de casa, zona de pr\u00e1ctica, nuevo equipo y multijugador m\u00e1s fluido.\",null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[\"The houses aren't empty anymore! Homeowners greet you, react to every mishap and chase you if you anger them. Plus new equipment, better connections and tons of fixes.\",\"Die H\u00e4user sind nicht mehr leer! Hausbesitzer reagieren auf jedes Missgeschick und jagen euch, wenn ihr sie ver\u00e4rgert. Dazu neue Ausr\u00fcstung und bessere Verbindungen.\",\"Les maisons ne sont plus vides ! Les propri\u00e9taires r\u00e9agissent \u00e0 chaque gaffe et vous poursuivent si vous les \u00e9nervez. Plus du nouvel \u00e9quipement et une meilleure connexion.\",\"Le case non sono pi\u00f9 vuote! I padroni di casa reagiscono a ogni guaio e vi inseguono se li fate arrabbiare. In pi\u00f9 nuova attrezzatura e connessione migliore.\",\"\uc774\uc81c \uc9d1\uc740 \ube44\uc5b4 \uc788\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4! \uc9d1\uc8fc\uc778\uc774 \ubaa8\ub4e0 \uc0ac\uace0\uc5d0 \ubc18\uc751\ud558\uace0, \ud654\ub098\uac8c \ud558\uba74 \ucad3\uc544\uc635\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc0c8\ub85c\uc6b4 \uc7a5\ube44\uc640 \uac1c\uc120\ub41c \uc5f0\uacb0\ub3c4 \ud568\uaed8\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4.\",\"\u00a1Las casas ya no est\u00e1n vac\u00edas! Los propietarios reaccionan a cada desastre y os persiguen si los enfad\u00e1is. Adem\u00e1s, nuevo equipo y mejor conexi\u00f3n.\",\"\u623f\u5b50\u4e0d\u518d\u7a7a\u8361\u8361\uff01\u5c4b\u4e3b\u4f1a\u5bf9\u6bcf\u4e00\u6b21\u5931\u8bef\u505a\u51fa\u53cd\u5e94\uff0c\u60f9\u607c\u4e86\u8fd8\u4f1a\u8ffd\u7740\u4f60\u8dd1\u3002\u6b64\u5916\u8fd8\u6709\u65b0\u88c5\u5907\u548c\u66f4\u597d\u7684\u8054\u673a\u4f53\u9a8c\u3002\",\"\u623f\u5b50\u4e0d\u518d\u7a7a\u8569\u8569\uff01\u5c4b\u4e3b\u6703\u5c0d\u6bcf\u4e00\u6b21\u5931\u8aa4\u505a\u51fa\u53cd\u61c9\uff0c\u60f9\u6bdb\u4e86\u9084\u6703\u8ffd\u8457\u4f60\u8dd1\u3002\u6b64\u5916\u9084\u6709\u65b0\u88dd\u5099\u548c\u66f4\u597d\u7684\u9023\u7dda\u9ad4\u9a57\u3002\",\"\u0414\u043e\u043c\u0430 \u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0435 \u043d\u0435 \u043f\u0443\u0441\u0442\u0443\u044e\u0442! \u0425\u043e\u0437\u044f\u0435\u0432\u0430 \u0440\u0435\u0430\u0433\u0438\u0440\u0443\u044e\u0442 \u043d\u0430 \u043a\u0430\u0436\u0434\u0443\u044e \u043d\u0435\u0443\u0434\u0430\u0447\u0443 \u0438 \u0433\u043e\u043d\u044f\u0442\u0441\u044f \u0437\u0430 \u0432\u0430\u043c\u0438, \u0435\u0441\u043b\u0438 \u0438\u0445 \u0440\u0430\u0437\u043e\u0437\u043b\u0438\u0442\u044c. \u0410 \u0435\u0449\u0451 \u043d\u043e\u0432\u043e\u0435 \u0441\u043d\u0430\u0440\u044f\u0436\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0438 \u0443\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0435\u043d\u043d\u043e\u0435 \u0441\u043e\u0435\u0434\u0438\u043d\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435.\",null,\"\u5bb6\u306f\u3082\u3046\u7a7a\u3063\u307d\u3058\u3083\u306a\u3044\uff01\u5bb6\u4e3b\u3055\u3093\u304c\u3042\u3089\u3086\u308b\u30cf\u30d7\u30cb\u30f3\u30b0\u306b\u53cd\u5fdc\u3057\u3001\u6012\u3089\u305b\u308b\u3068\u8ffd\u3044\u304b\u3051\u3066\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3055\u3089\u306b\u65b0\u88c5\u5099\u3084\u63a5\u7d9a\u306e\u6539\u5584\u3082\u3002\",null,\"Domy nie s\u0105 ju\u017c puste! W\u0142a\u015bciciele reaguj\u0105 na ka\u017cd\u0105 wpadk\u0119 i goni\u0105 was, gdy ich zdenerwujecie. Do tego nowy sprz\u0119t i lepsze po\u0142\u0105czenie.\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"Evler art\u0131k bo\u015f de\u011fil! Ev sahipleri sizi kar\u015f\u0131l\u0131yor, her kazaya tepki veriyor ve k\u0131z\u0131nca pe\u015finize d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcyor. Ayr\u0131ca yeni ekipmanlar, daha iyi ba\u011flant\u0131 ve onlarca d\u00fczeltme.\",\"As casas n\u00e3o est\u00e3o mais vazias! Os donos reagem a cada desastre e correm atr\u00e1s de voc\u00eas se ficarem bravos. Al\u00e9m disso, novos equipamentos e conex\u00e3o melhor.\",null,null,null,null,\"\u00a1Las casas ya no est\u00e1n vac\u00edas! Los due\u00f1os reaccionan a cada desastre y los persiguen si los hacen enojar. Adem\u00e1s, nuevo equipo y mejor conexi\u00f3n.\",null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"780d78524166cfb488ca0655054f619fc9d94f56.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[]}","announcement_body":{"gid":"489361401348883262","clanid":"46269316","posterid":"0","headline":"Demo 1.7: The Homeowners Have Arrived!","posttime":1792361882,"updatetime":1792361882,"body":"[p][img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}\/46269316\/780d78524166cfb488ca0655054f619fc9d94f56.png\"][\/img]\nHi everyone!\n\nSteam Next Fest has begun, and we've brought our biggest demo update yet. The biggest change: the houses aren't empty anymore, the homeowners are waiting for you!\n\n[\/p][h2]Highlights[\/h2][list][*][p][b]Homeowners:[\/b] They greet you on every job and watch the whole move. They react instantly to items hitting walls, broken parts and thrown boxes. Each one has their own personality and a favorite item. Keep them happy for a big tip, but make them too angry and they'll come after you! In the demo you'll meet Picky Auntie and Easygoing Uncle.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]Training area:[\/b] Practice with boxes, equipment, the pallet jack, throwing and jumping on the lower floor of the Warehouse.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]New equipment and surprises:[\/b] Inflatable mats, trampolines, gas canisters that can explode and toilets you can break. Break one in a client's house and the repair bill is on you!\n[\/p][\/*][*][p][b]Better connections:[\/b] Accurate ping, smoother players and items, and faster connections with Steam friends. The lobby browser shows estimated ping for every room, and the host can kick players. Players who join late or reconnect now return to the job correctly.\n[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]\n[\/p][h2]Other New Features[\/h2][list][*][p]Redesigned job sheet (J), radar (X) and map (M). Added pinging with the middle mouse button.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Hardware stores selling equipment in the Warehouse and in town, a gazebo to relax in at the Warehouse, and two new decorations for your truck.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]New graphics presets, an FOV setting and overall FPS improvements.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Many improvements to controller (gamepad) support.\n[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]\n[\/p][h2]Carrying & Truck[\/h2][list][*][p]Fixed items suddenly launching and jittering, and characters clipping into items during two-player carrying.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]The truck no longer gets launched when getting in or out, when the driver is pulled out through the door, or when it touches the ground. Loads no longer come loose on slopes.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]Tailgate: press E to slide items in; if they don't fit, hold to force it shut.\n[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]\n[\/p][h2]Economy[\/h2][list][*][p]Job pay now goes down with item damage, and destroyed items add a contract penalty.\n[\/p][\/*][*][p]The time bonus has been removed, and the end-of-job receipt has been simplified.\n[\/p][\/*][\/list][p]\nPlus dozens of small bug fixes! Your demo saves are now kept in a separate folder from the full game.\n\nThanks to everyone who played the demo! You can send us your thoughts with the feedback button in the main menu. If you enjoyed it, don't forget to add the game to your wishlist![\/p]","commentcount":0,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_487176015_1792364849_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"706660344651711441","event_gid":"489361401348883261","voteupcount":6,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"706660344651711441","rtime32_last_modified":1793126466,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1792364850,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1792360273,"votes_up":6,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"565919968340751644","gidfeature2":"706660344651711441"},{"gid":"705533459844566073","clan_steamid":"103582791475790724","event_name":"Demo Update: Smoother Carrying, Higher FPS","event_type":14,"appid":4776500,"server_address":null,"server_password":null,"rtime32_start_time":1791749160,"rtime32_end_time":1791750480,"comment_count":0,"creator_steamid":"0","last_update_steamid":"0","event_notes":"see announcement body","jsondata":"{\"localized_subtitle\":[\"We heard your feedback: big improvements to physics, performance and multiplayer.\",\"Wir haben euer Feedback geh\u00f6rt: gro\u00dfe Verbesserungen bei Physik, Performance und Multiplayer.\",\"Nous avons \u00e9cout\u00e9 vos retours : grosses am\u00e9liorations de la physique, des performances et du multijoueur.\",\"Abbiamo ascoltato i vostri feedback: grandi miglioramenti a fisica, prestazioni e multigiocatore.\",\"\uc5ec\ub7ec\ubd84\uc758 \ud53c\ub4dc\ubc31\uc744 \ubc18\uc601\ud574 \ubb3c\ub9ac, \uc131\ub2a5, \uba40\ud2f0\ud50c\ub808\uc774\ub97c \ud06c\uac8c \uac1c\uc120\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\",\"Hemos escuchado vuestros comentarios: grandes mejoras en f\u00edsicas, rendimiento y multijugador.\",\"\u6211\u4eec\u542c\u53d6\u4e86\u5927\u5bb6\u7684\u53cd\u9988\uff1a\u7269\u7406\u3001\u6027\u80fd\u548c\u591a\u4eba\u8054\u673a\u5168\u9762\u5927\u5e45\u6539\u8fdb\u3002\",\"\u6211\u5011\u807d\u53d6\u4e86\u5927\u5bb6\u7684\u56de\u994b\uff1a\u7269\u7406\u3001\u6548\u80fd\u8207\u591a\u4eba\u9023\u7dda\u5168\u9762\u5927\u5e45\u6539\u5584\u3002\",\"\u041c\u044b \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0441\u043b\u0443\u0448\u0430\u043b\u0438\u0441\u044c \u043a \u0432\u0430\u0448\u0438\u043c \u043e\u0442\u0437\u044b\u0432\u0430\u043c: \u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0438\u0435 \u0443\u043b\u0443\u0447\u0448\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0444\u0438\u0437\u0438\u043a\u0438, \u043f\u0440\u043e\u0438\u0437\u0432\u043e\u0434\u0438\u0442\u0435\u043b\u044c\u043d\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0438 \u0438 \u043c\u0443\u043b\u044c\u0442\u0438\u043f\u043b\u0435\u0435\u0440\u0430.\",null,\"\u7686\u3055\u3093\u306e\u30d5\u30a3\u30fc\u30c9\u30d0\u30c3\u30af\u3092\u53d7\u3051\u3066\u3001\u7269\u7406\u6319\u52d5\u30fb\u30d1\u30d5\u30a9\u30fc\u30de\u30f3\u30b9\u30fb\u30de\u30eb\u30c1\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u3092\u5927\u304d\u304f\u6539\u5584\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002\",null,\"Wys\u0142uchali\u015bmy waszych opinii: du\u017ce usprawnienia fizyki, wydajno\u015bci i trybu wieloosobowego.\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"Geri bildirimlerinizi dinledik: fizik, performans ve \u00e7ok oyunculu taraf\u0131nda b\u00fcy\u00fck iyile\u015ftirmeler.\",\"Ouvimos o feedback de voc\u00eas: grandes melhorias na f\u00edsica, no desempenho e no multijogador.\",null,null,null,null,\"Escuchamos sus comentarios: grandes mejoras en f\u00edsicas, rendimiento y multijugador.\",null,null,null,null],\"localized_summary\":[\"A big demo update is here! New graphics settings, higher FPS, much smoother two-player carrying and fixes for the physics bugs you reported.\",\"Ein gro\u00dfes Demo-Update ist da! Neue Grafikeinstellungen, mehr FPS, deutlich fl\u00fcssigeres Tragen zu zweit und Fixes f\u00fcr die gemeldeten Physik-Bugs.\",\"Grosse mise \u00e0 jour de la d\u00e9mo ! Nouveaux r\u00e9glages graphiques, plus de FPS, transport \u00e0 deux bien plus fluide et corrections des bugs physiques signal\u00e9s.\",\"\u00c8 arrivato un grande aggiornamento della demo! Nuove impostazioni grafiche, pi\u00f9 FPS, trasporto in due molto pi\u00f9 fluido e correzioni ai bug di fisica segnalati.\",\"\ub370\ubaa8 \ub300\uaddc\ubaa8 \uc5c5\ub370\uc774\ud2b8\uac00 \uc801\uc6a9\ub418\uc5c8\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4! \uc0c8\ub85c\uc6b4 \uadf8\ub798\ud53d \uc124\uc815, FPS \ud5a5\uc0c1, \ud6e8\uc52c \ubd80\ub4dc\ub7ec\uc6cc\uc9c4 2\uc778 \uc6b4\ubc18, \uadf8\ub9ac\uace0 \uc81c\ubcf4\ud574 \uc8fc\uc2e0 \ubb3c\ub9ac \ubc84\uadf8 \uc218\uc815\uc774 \ud3ec\ud568\ub418\uc5b4 \uc788\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\",\"\u00a1Llega una gran actualizaci\u00f3n de la demo! Nuevos ajustes gr\u00e1ficos, m\u00e1s FPS, transporte a dos mucho m\u00e1s fluido y arreglos para los fallos de f\u00edsicas reportados.\",\"\u8bd5\u73a9\u7248\u5927\u578b\u66f4\u65b0\u6765\u4e86\uff01\u5168\u65b0\u56fe\u5f62\u8bbe\u7f6e\u3001\u66f4\u9ad8\u5e27\u6570\u3001\u66f4\u6d41\u7545\u7684\u53cc\u4eba\u642c\u8fd0\uff0c\u5e76\u4fee\u590d\u4e86\u5927\u5bb6\u53cd\u9988\u7684\u7269\u7406\u95ee\u9898\u3002\",\"\u8a66\u73a9\u7248\u5927\u578b\u66f4\u65b0\u4f86\u4e86\uff01\u5168\u65b0\u5716\u5f62\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3001\u66f4\u9ad8 FPS\u3001\u66f4\u6d41\u66a2\u7684\u96d9\u4eba\u642c\u904b\uff0c\u4e26\u4fee\u6b63\u4e86\u5927\u5bb6\u56de\u5831\u7684\u7269\u7406\u554f\u984c\u3002\",\"\u0412\u044b\u0448\u043b\u043e \u043a\u0440\u0443\u043f\u043d\u043e\u0435 \u043e\u0431\u043d\u043e\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u0435 \u0434\u0435\u043c\u043e! \u041d\u043e\u0432\u044b\u0435 \u043d\u0430\u0441\u0442\u0440\u043e\u0439\u043a\u0438 \u0433\u0440\u0430\u0444\u0438\u043a\u0438, \u0431\u043e\u043b\u044c\u0448\u0435 FPS, \u0433\u043e\u0440\u0430\u0437\u0434\u043e \u0431\u043e\u043b\u0435\u0435 \u043f\u043b\u0430\u0432\u043d\u0430\u044f \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u043d\u043e\u0441\u043a\u0430 \u0432\u0434\u0432\u043e\u0451\u043c \u0438 \u0438\u0441\u043f\u0440\u0430\u0432\u043b\u0435\u043d\u0438\u044f \u0444\u0438\u0437\u0438\u0447\u0435\u0441\u043a\u0438\u0445 \u0431\u0430\u0433\u043e\u0432 \u0438\u0437 \u0432\u0430\u0448\u0438\u0445 \u043e\u0442\u0437\u044b\u0432\u043e\u0432.\",null,\"\u30c7\u30e2\u306e\u5927\u578b\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u30c7\u30fc\u30c8\u3092\u914d\u4fe1\u3057\u307e\u3057\u305f\uff01\u65b0\u3057\u3044\u30b0\u30e9\u30d5\u30a3\u30c3\u30af\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3001FPS\u5411\u4e0a\u30012\u4eba\u904b\u642c\u306e\u5927\u5e45\u6539\u5584\u3001\u305d\u3057\u3066\u5831\u544a\u3044\u305f\u3060\u3044\u305f\u7269\u7406\u30d0\u30b0\u306e\u4fee\u6b63\u3092\u884c\u3044\u307e\u3057\u305f\u3002\",null,\"Wielka aktualizacja dema ju\u017c jest! Nowe ustawienia grafiki, wi\u0119cej FPS, du\u017co p\u0142ynniejsze noszenie we dw\u00f3ch i poprawki zg\u0142oszonych b\u0142\u0119d\u00f3w fizyki.\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,\"Demoya b\u00fcy\u00fck g\u00fcncelleme geldi! Yeni grafik ayarlar\u0131, daha y\u00fcksek FPS, \u00e7ok daha ak\u0131c\u0131 iki ki\u015filik ta\u015f\u0131ma ve bildirdi\u011finiz fizik hatalar\u0131na d\u00fczeltmeler.\",\"Chegou uma grande atualiza\u00e7\u00e3o da demo! Novas configura\u00e7\u00f5es gr\u00e1ficas, mais FPS, transporte em dupla muito mais fluido e corre\u00e7\u00f5es para os bugs de f\u00edsica relatados.\",null,null,null,null,\"\u00a1Lleg\u00f3 una gran actualizaci\u00f3n de la demo! Nuevos ajustes gr\u00e1ficos, m\u00e1s FPS, transporte de a dos mucho m\u00e1s fluido y arreglos para los errores de f\u00edsicas reportados.\",null,null,null,null],\"localized_title_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_capsule_image\":[\"fc7bbcb756f15f386a0d8f5f0dd1197908c2878b.png\",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"bSaleEnabled\":false,\"sale_show_creator\":false,\"sale_sections\":[],\"sale_browsemore_text\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_url\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_color\":\"\",\"sale_browsemore_bgcolor\":\"\",\"localized_sale_header\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_overlay\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_product_mobile_banner\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_sale_logo\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"sale_font\":\"\",\"sale_background_color\":\"\",\"sale_header_offset\":530,\"referenced_appids\":[],\"bBroadcastEnabled\":false,\"broadcastChatSetting\":\"hide\",\"default_broadcast_title\":\"#Broadcast_default_title_dev\",\"localized_broadcast_title\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_left_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"localized_broadcast_right_image\":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null],\"broadcast_whitelist\":[],\"bScheduleEnabled\":false,\"scheduleEntries\":[]}","announcement_body":{"gid":"705533459844566074","clanid":"46269316","posterid":"0","headline":"Demo Update: Smoother Carrying, Higher FPS","posttime":1791749185,"updatetime":1791749185,"body":"Hi everyone!\n\nThank you to everyone who played the demo and left a review. Most of you mentioned physics bugs, stuttering and how hard carrying felt, so this update is built entirely around that.\n\n[h2]Highlights[\/h2]\n[list]\n[*][b]Smoother carrying:[\/b] Your grip no longer breaks during two-player carrying, and items no longer clip into your body or snag on the ground.\n[*][b]Physics fixes:[\/b] Removed the invisible collider bug that stopped players and items in their tracks. The truck no longer gets flung around, and items no longer slip under the truck bed or get launched.\n[*][b]Higher FPS:[\/b] Less stuttering, and the FPS drop while carrying heavy items is gone. With the new graphics settings, even low-end PCs can run the game comfortably (yes, there's a \"Potato\" preset \ud83d\ude04).\n[*][b]Multiplayer:[\/b] One-click friend invites, a player list and much clearer voice chat.\n[\/list]\n\nFull patch notes below \ud83d\udc47\n[hr][\/hr]\n\n[h2]Performance & Graphics[\/h2]\n[list]\n[*]Graphics settings overhauled: Potato \/ Low \/ Medium \/ High presets, plus a Custom option where you can tweak everything individually.\n[*]Display settings: resolution scale, FSR upscaling, anti-aliasing, shadows, texture quality, texture filtering, model detail, grass distance, mirror quality.\n[*]Effect settings: cartoon filter, ambient occlusion (SSAO), fog, bloom, depth of field, lens effects.\n[*]Resolution and display mode (fullscreen \/ borderless \/ windowed), V-Sync, FPS limit.\n[*]The best settings for your PC are picked automatically on first launch. Use \"Auto Detect\" to re-run it anytime.\n[*]Overall FPS is up and stuttering is noticeably reduced. Fixed the FPS drop while carrying heavy items.\n[*]Menus no longer overflow on non-16:9 and ultrawide screens.\n[\/list]\n\n[h2]Carrying[\/h2]\n[list]\n[*]Two-player carrying is much smoother: when walking, strafing or running together, the item no longer drags your partner and the grip doesn't break.\n[*]Items no longer clip into the carrier's body; hands now stay on the item's surface.\n[*]In solo carrying, items no longer catch on the ground or road seams and stop you in your tracks.\n[\/list]\n\n[h2]Multiplayer[\/h2]\n[list]\n[*]Player list on Tab: ping, mute, Steam profile, kick player, set lobby to private\/public.\n[*]ESC > Invite Friends: invite online Steam friends with one click.\n[*]Voice chat is much clearer. Removed the echo in the Warehouse, and voices no longer get muffled behind items.\n[\/list]\n\n[h2]Missions & UI[\/h2]\n[list]\n[*]Entering the tunnel now goes straight to the loading screen; the truck starts parked at the tunnel exit in the mission area.\n[*]New loading screen with 20 in-game tips.\n[*]The day now starts at the brightest hour at the mission house and moves toward late afternoon as the mission goes on.\n[*]Redesigned mission countdown, mission and boarding panels, and installment reminder. The installment card no longer overlaps the mission briefing.\n[*]Fixed menu text staying in the old language after switching languages.\n[\/list]\n\n[h2]Bug Fixes[\/h2]\n[list]\n[*]Removed the invisible collider that stopped players and items in some areas.\n[*]Guest players couldn't push doors while holding an item.\n[*]The truck got flung around when its rear door was opened.\n[*]The vehicle camera (C) shook because of flying items and pole debris.\n[*]Items slipped under the truck bed; rescued items got launched.\n[*]Guest players saw an English message when the host ended the session.\n[*]Item value labels were hidden behind walls.\n[*]Screen tearing at unlimited FPS; V-Sync is now on by default.\n[*]Fixed stutters during the tunnel transition on slow connections.\n[*]Small tweaks to smoking, basketball shots and Rock-Paper-Scissors.\n[\/list]\n\nStill running into problems? Let us know in the Discussions tab, we read everything. See you at Next Fest (October 19-26), happy moving!","commentcount":0,"tags":["mod_reviewed","ModAct_487176015_1791750819_0"],"language":0,"hidden":0,"forum_topic_id":"588440207635923005","event_gid":"705533459844566073","voteupcount":3,"votedowncount":0,"ban_check_result":0,"banned":0},"published":1,"hidden":0,"rtime32_visibility_start":0,"rtime32_visibility_end":0,"broadcaster_accountid":0,"follower_count":0,"ignore_count":0,"forum_topic_id":"588440207635923005","rtime32_last_modified":1792166868,"news_post_gid":"0","rtime_mod_reviewed":1791750820,"featured_app_tagid":0,"referenced_appids":[],"build_id":0,"build_branch":"","unlisted":0,"rtime_created":1791746665,"votes_up":3,"votes_down":0,"comment_type":"ForumTopic","gidfeature":"565919968340751644","gidfeature2":"588440207635923005"}],"EventWebRowEmbed":{"bPreLoaded":true,"announcementGIDList":["489361401348883262","705533459844566074"],"last_update_event":{"rtime":1792361880,"event_gid":"489361401348883261","announcement_gid":"489361401348883262","clan_account_id":46269316}}};
						</script>
					

					<div data-featuretarget="events-row"></div>
				
								
				
				


								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" >Carry On Together is a physics-based online co-op moving game for up to 4 players.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Start a small delivery company with your friends, take on moving jobs and try to get every item to its destination in one piece. Break the furniture, crash the truck, lose all your earnings or hold it together as a team. Can you keep the company alive?</p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>LIFT TOGETHER</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Some items are too heavy to carry alone. Stretch out your arms, sync up with your teammates and lift together with physics-based controls. Couches, fridges, pianos and giant boxes all need teamwork. Watch out for tight corridors, slippery stairs and that one friend who lets go at the worst possible moment.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/5a6d27e6eb0f815e914fd190b3dd2c01.poster.avif?t=1793038446" width=800 height=350 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/5a6d27e6eb0f815e914fd190b3dd2c01.webm?t=1793038446" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/5a6d27e6eb0f815e914fd190b3dd2c01.mp4?t=1793038446" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>DRIVE THE TRUCK</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Load the delivery truck, pick a driver and hit the road. Enjoy the view on the way, but stay alert: one sharp turn and the whole cargo flies. The road might be the most dangerous part of the job. Do you trust your driver?</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/24cf4ca5f714b60bb1eda0d91fb05605.poster.avif?t=1793038446" width=800 height=350 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/24cf4ca5f714b60bb1eda0d91fb05605.webm?t=1793038446" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/24cf4ca5f714b60bb1eda0d91fb05605.mp4?t=1793038446" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>EVERY LOCATION IS A NEW DISASTER</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >From suburban houses with wide gardens to multi-story office buildings, from narrow apartment hallways to mountain dirt roads, every location brings its own kind of chaos. Fit the sofa in the elevator, roll the rock off the road, squeeze the wardrobe through the garden gate.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ><span class="bb_img_ctn"><video class="bb_img" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/1aad201e8bd421142160a1e30f1b958b.poster.avif?t=1793038446" width=800 height=350 ><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/1aad201e8bd421142160a1e30f1b958b.webm?t=1793038446" type="video/webm; codecs=vp9"><source src="https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4776500/extras/1aad201e8bd421142160a1e30f1b958b.mp4?t=1793038446" type="video/mp4"></video></span></p><h2 class="bb_tag" ><strong>GROW YOUR COMPANY</strong></h2><p class="bb_paragraph" >Every successful delivery earns money, and every broken item costs you. Upgrade your company, take on bigger jobs and prove you're the best (or worst) movers in town.</p>						</div>
					</div>
				
				
				
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse sys_req" style="max-height: 300px;">
		<h2>System Requirements</h2>
				<div class="sysreq_contents">
							<div class="game_area_sys_req sysreq_content active" data-os="win">
											<div class="game_area_sys_req_leftCol">
							<ul>
								<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class="bb_ul"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5 6600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>							</ul>
						</div>
